Ahead of the lawmen</i>

138
00:08:34.444 --> 00:08:36.448
<i>♪ That's all
And that's no joke</i>

139
00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:38.916
<i>♪ These guys
Don't appreciate I'm broke</i>

140
00:08:40.083 --> 00:08:41.987
<i>♪ Riffraff!
Street rat!</i>

141
00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.022
- <i>♪ Scoundrel!</i>
- <i>♪ Take that!</i>

142
00:08:44.155 --> 00:08:47.391
<i>♪ Try a dif'rent tack, guys</i>

143
00:08:50.127 --> 00:08:54.398
- <i>♪ Rip him open!</i>
- <i>♪ 'Round the back, guys</i>

144
00:08:54.498 --> 00:08:56.033
<i>♪ I can take a hint
Gotta face the facts</i>

145
00:08:56.166 --> 00:08:58.369
<i>♪ Could really use
A friend or two!</i>

146
00:08:58.502 --> 00:09:01.473
<i>♪ Oh, it's sad
Aladdin's hit the bottom</i>

147
00:09:01.606 --> 00:09:02.607
Ooh, ladies!

148
00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:05.376
<i>♪ He's become
A one-man rise in crime</i>

149
00:09:05.477 --> 00:09:06.545
Well...

150
00:09:07.578 --> 00:09:10.114
<i>♪ I'd blame parents
'Cept he hasn't got 'em</i>

151
00:09:10.448 --> 00:09:11.917
<i>♪ Gotta eat to live
Gotta steal to eat</i>

152
00:09:12.049 --> 00:09:14.119
<i>♪ Tell you all about it
When I got the time</i>

153
00:09:20.558 --> 00:09:21.559
Huh?

154
00:09:27.964 --> 00:09:29.867
There are stairs, you know.

155
00:09:29.968 --> 00:09:31.602
Where's the fun in that?

156
00:09:31.736 --> 00:09:33.605
<i>♪ One jump
Ahead of the slowpokes</i>

157
00:09:33.737 --> 00:09:35.506
<i>♪ One skip ahead of my doom</i>

158
00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:37.976
