Gonna use a nom de plume</i>

159
00:09:39.609 --> 00:09:41.579
<i>♪ One jump
Ahead of the hit men</i>

160
00:09:41.679 --> 00:09:43.048
<i>♪ One hit ahead of the flock</i>

161
00:09:43.747 --> 00:09:46.884
<i>♪ I think I'll take a stroll
Around the block</i>

162
00:09:49.654 --> 00:09:51.155
<i>- ♪ Stop, thief!</i>
<i>- ♪ Vandal!</i>

163
00:09:51.256 --> 00:09:52.424
Abu!

164
00:09:52.524 --> 00:09:53.558
<i>♪ Scandal!</i>

165
00:09:53.657 --> 00:09:57.396
<i>♪ Let's not be too hasty</i>

166
00:09:57.527 --> 00:10:01.399
<i>♪ Still, I think
He's rather tasty</i>

167
00:10:01.531 --> 00:10:03.167
<i>♪ Gotta eat to live
Gotta steal to eat</i>

168
